    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a lot of noise though. even the \"small things\" feel pointless. it's like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. if i finally just let go, there wouldn't even be a ripple. no one would have to change anything, no one would have to clean anything up... it would just be quiet. wouldn't that be a relief?",
